I don't know how tough the Knight quest is, but if I'm worried, I 
usually try the Castle before the quest.  The WOW should make your 
knight invicible (if used correctly).

Make sure you get speed boots, and intrinsic speed.  This makes your hit
points last much longer.  With speed boots (or ideally a ring of conlict),
I wouldn't hesitate to try the castle. Also, try quaffing once from all
fountains to improve your stats.
